# A run that clears the sign bit of a value whose range is unknown is its
# remainder mod 2^15 in a 16-bit and; in a 64-bit mask of more runs,
# where 2^63 is no modulus, it is refused, the parameter's address a
# uniform variable. Each kernel's store, past its `.entry` line, prints
# its address and its sectors per warp request.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/and_sign_remainder.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_and_sign_b16( // block 32×1×1 | per CTA: global store 128 B; param load 320 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store [param_0 + 4·(param_1 mod 32768)] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_and_sign_wide_runs( // block 32×1×1 | per CTA: global store 128 B; param load 512 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd5], %r1; // global store [4·uniform(%rd3@51) + param_0] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
